n_us/inspector/latest/user/code-security-assessments-create-configuration.html" /><meta name="keywords" content="Amazon Inspector,inspector,code,security,create,configuration" /><link rel="alternate" type="text/markdown" href="code-security-assessments-create-configuration.md" title="Markdown version" /><script type="application/ld+json">
{
